{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4b785994-f3ac-8f46-938e-6b937e283003",
  "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:22:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Barbara Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:16:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:16:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Good afternoon. My name is Barbara Peckham. I am calling about a drain, the catch basin, on the corner near my house. It is full of leaves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:17:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a catch basin full of leaves. Is it flooding right now? Is there a storm going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:17:17-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no storm. Is dry, many days no rain. But the water just sit there. A big puddle at the corner. It never go down. This is almost one month now, maybe more."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:17:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A month. Okay. So the puddle is just sitting there even in dry weather, because the drain is blocked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:17:41-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. The leaves cover the top, all pile up, and nothing go inside. In the morning the puddle get ice on it. I am worry somebody slip, but also, it is the same every day. Nobody come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:17:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Let me get the location. What's the address, or the nearest cross streets?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:18:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I prefer not to give my house. I am neighbor only. I can tell you the corner, but I need to think the name. [pause] Sorry, one moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:18:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:18:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. The corner of Bellevue and Memorial. Near the bus stop sign, on the side with the little stone wall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:18:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, Bellevue and Memorial. Alright, I'm noting the bus stop and the stone wall. Have you called about this one before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:18:40-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I call before, maybe three week ago. A person tell me it is a state road, so is not the city. Not your department. I say okay, thank you, and I wait. But nothing happen. Still the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:18:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you remember who you talked to, or which office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:19:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I do not remember the name. A woman. She was nice, but she say state road and that is all. I did not know what to do after that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:19:16-05:00",
      "duration": 31,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. Some of the main roads around there are state roads, so that might be right for the road itself. But I can't tell from here which side that basin belongs to. I'll put in a request with the location and have somebody look at who owns it. If it's ours, it gets cleaned. If it's the state's, we'll pass it along to them ourselves so you aren't the one chasing it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:19:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that would be very good. Because I am only one old lady calling, and everybody say it is somebody else. I am a little tired of this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:20:00-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand, and you shouldn't have to be the go-between. So the request is to clean the leaves out of the catch basin and look at the standing water. Is the grate itself covered, or is it that the pipe underneath is backed up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:20:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think the top is covered. Leaves, a little dirt, some plastic bag. I cannot see inside. But the water is not going anywhere, so maybe both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:20:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good to know, I'll note that. Can I get a number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:20:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Is four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:20:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-nine. Got it. And it's under Peckham, P-E-C-K-H-A-M?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:20:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. You spell very good. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:20:52-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's the one I hear all day. Now, it's December, so crews are tied up with leaves and plows both, but this goes in today. I'd say give it a week, and if the puddle's still there, call me back and mention this request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:21:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week. Okay. I will wait. And if you need to send to the state, please you tell them is the corner with the stone wall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:21:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that right in the notes, stone wall and bus stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:21:30-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. You know, I am the kind of person who read the whole menu at restaurant, every page. So when I call, I also want to hear everything, every step. Sorry, I talk too long."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:21:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not at all, that's how I like the details. You gave me a good description. Anything else going on over there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:21:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Just the drain. Thank you for your help, Miss Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:22:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mrs. Peckham. Stay warm, and watch your step on that corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:22:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
